Ok so the first step is to run the armPath_setter.py file, u will see an interface where you can position the 3 
links of the arm, the small one is the scoop. so the links are easy to understand how you are gonna position it in 
the interface, but for the scoop you can consider the vertical surface at the back of scoop as the line in the interface. 
So the first step is to set all the theta sweeps of all 3 links to 0 and then use the 0 reference slider to set your minimum 
positions of all the links at any point in time(take clockwise as direction getting to zero or minimum ). 
